    "summary": "I fixed two bugs in `cache/lru.py`, and the tests pass (2 passed).\n\n- **`get`:** a hit now moves the key to the most-recently-used position. Before, reading an entry didn't count as using it, so recently read entries were evicted first.\n- **`put`:** updating an existing key no longer evicts another entry. It now refreshes that key's position. Eviction only happens when a new key is added to a full cache.\n\nThe public API is unchanged.",
